guide aurum-druid/wetlands-prerequisites
title 20 - Cat Form and the Menethil stop
faction Alliance
race NightElf
class Druid
levels 20-24
zone Wetlands
category Dungeons
folder Aurum - Druid and dungeons
version 6
next aurum-druid/redridge-outdoors

step Cat Form begins in Darnassus
  zone Darnassus
  tip Cat Form comes from a Forever class quest at 20. Speak with Mathrengyl Bearwalker, then cast Teleport: Moonglade for Dendrite. Already completed this chain? Its quests should check off.
  level 20

step Teleport and fly to your trainer
  zone Moonglade
  tip Cast Teleport: Moonglade, ask Silva Fil'naveth for her free Druid flight to Rut'theran Village, and take the portal up to Darnassus. Silva's flight needs no unlock.
  teleport 18960
  fly "Rut'theran Village" npc 11800

step Mathrengyl in Darnassus
  zone Darnassus
  accept 98393 -- Mathrengyl is on the middle level of the tree; climb the ramp.

step Dendrite and the Great Cat Spirit
  zone Moonglade
  teleport 18960
  turnin 98393 -- Dendrite is upstairs in the Nighthaven building.
  accept 98394
  turnin 98394
  accept 98396

step Recover the three relics
  tip Follow the quest into the Stormrage Barrow Den and recover each relic. Read the quest's help and nearby interaction text before entering; use the protection it offers rather than fighting through the dens.
  complete 98396
  turnin 98396
  accept 98731
  turnin 98731
  accept 98397

step Return for Cat Form
  zone Darnassus
  tip Ask Silva Fil'naveth for her free flight to Rut'theran Village, then take the portal to Mathrengyl to receive Cat Form. Afterward, travel to Menethil Harbor for the Wetlands preparation.
  fly "Rut'theran Village" npc 11800
  turnin 98397

step Auberdine boat to Menethil
  zone Darkshore
  tip Leave Darnassus through the Rut'theran portal and fly to Auberdine. Take the Menethil boat from the southern branch of the long pier. Disembark at Menethil for a short crocolisk task, then fly south. The harder Greenwarden combat waits for our later level-25 visit.
  fly "Auberdine"
  goto 32.34,44.13 "Auberdine: boat to Menethil" era r 30

step Menethil: crocolisk skins while passing
  zone Wetlands
  tip Learn the flight path and finish the nearby young-crocolisk skins while changing from boat to flight. Do not cross the marsh for higher-level Fen Creepers now: the later Wetlands outdoor chapter completes that dungeon prerequisite at an appropriate level.
  getfp "Menethil Harbor" npc 1571
  vendor 1450 -- Brahnmar: repair equipment; the innkeeper next supplies your drinks.
  vendor 1464 -- Sell and refill affordable level-15 drinks at the harbor inn before leaving town.
  buy 1205 x20 npc 1464 optional
  accept 484 lvl 18 -- James Halloran in Menethil. This prerequisite unlocks Highland Hides for the later Excavation Site trip.
  collect 3397 npc 1417 x4 quest 484.1 @13.35,54.72 era -- Kill Young Wetlands Crocolisks just outside Menethil on the way east; avoid higher-level crocolisks.

step Menethil before returning south
  tip Return to the harbor after the young-crocolisk task. Deliver the young crocolisk skins now, so the level-24 dungeon follow-up will be available on the later visit. Fly to Stormwind for the next southern chapter using the flights learned on the dungeon route.
  turnin 484
  vendor 1450 -- Brahnmar: repair equipment; the innkeeper next supplies your drinks.
  vendor 1464 -- Sell, repair nearby, and keep enough drinks for the southern journey.
  fly "Stormwind"

